  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicountry Africa ECSA-HC - RSSH - East, Central and Southern Africa Health Community</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicountry Africa ECSA-HC - RSSH - East, Central and Southern Africa Health Community - ECSA-HC.  This program has the following goals: Strengthening Integrated laboratory systems. The objectives of this program are: Strengthening mechanisms on Disease outbreak Response and Preparedness in the Region.  Capacity building for in country IVD performance evaluation in Africa.  Expansion of scope and provision of integrated EQA schemes including PT for Malaria RDTs.  Supporting Establishment of COEs and SRLs within the ECSA region.  Building capacity for Antimicrobial Resistance Surveillance: Strengthen the functioning of AMR surveillance sentinel laboratories to support AMR surveillance in Human and animal health</narrative>
  </description>
